# Files in the built asset directory that must NOT be uploaded or served.
#
# This file doubles as the placeholder that keeps ./public present in git, so a
# fresh clone can run `wrangler dev` and the test suite before anything has been
# built. Wrangler never uploads .assetsignore itself.
#
# Source maps are uploaded deliberately: the whole app is behind Cloudflare
# Access, and a readable stack trace is how a staff member's bug report becomes
# actionable. Remove the comment and add *.map here if that ever changes.
